================================================================================
WHY AGPL-3.0
================================================================================

The open-vocabulary detector behind the "AI Text" tool is derived from YOLOE,
which is AGPL-3.0. Weights derived from an AGPL work carry that license into
whatever ships them, so the whole project is AGPL-3.0. Building without the
detector (`bun run setup`, no `--detector`) drops that dependency, but the
project's own license does not change.


